# Dart tooling (flutter gen-l10n, build_runner) always writes LF, but this repo
# is cloned with core.autocrlf=true, which expects CRLF in the working tree.
# Without pinning these, every build leaves the generated files looking modified
# with no actual content change — enough to block `git checkout`.
*.dart text eol=lf
*.arb  text eol=lf
